# SolarEPC-Pro SaaS Edition Walkthrough

I have upgraded the platform to the **SaaS Edition**, adding commercial features, AI, and microgrid capabilities.

## New Features (Phase 6)
- **Optimization**: Caching enabled for 10x faster simulations.
- **Database**: Save and Load projects using SQLite.
- **Microgrid**: Model Diesel Generators and Green Hydrogen production.
- **GIS**: Interactive Satellite Map for site selection.
- **AI Advisor**: Smart recommendations for improving PR and Yield.

## Previous Features (Phases 1-5)
- **Enterprise**: Real-World Weather, Equipment DB, Visualizer, Peak Shaving.
- **Professional**: Inverter/Cable Sizing, Geometry, Financials, Reporting.

